    {
      "id": "DinqTAskuRcalEGRpInnJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 541110.0519673843,
      "y": 37177.644659968726,
      "width": 1177.48779296875,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 998793361,
      "version": 261,
      "versionNonce": 1155915665,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785138652100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "let suppose in every new order if everything orderbook in balancer in DB\nthen\n\nso every new order\n1 . Read order book\n2. Sort orders\n3. Find the best match\n4. Update balances\n5. Write fills/ Trades\n6. Update remaining quantity",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "let suppose in every new order if everything orderbook in balancer in DB\nthen\n\nso every new order\n1 . Read order book\n2. Sort orders\n3. Find the best match\n4. Update balances\n5. Write fills/ Trades\n6. Update remaining quantity",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PN_XAgUaIizdos4xHc-BF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 541112.5518529434,
      "y": 37673.894659968726,
      "width": 1192.5736618041997,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 66444593,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 1140749041,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785138671980,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If all of that happens by repeatedly querying PostgreSQL, every trade\nincurs disk I/O, locks, and network overhead. Under heavy load, latency\ngrows quickly.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If all of that happens by repeatedly querying PostgreSQL, every trade incurs disk I/O, locks, and network overhead. Under heavy load, latency grows quickly.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
