    {
      "id": "FwQLUx4VBPcZT9s7qwnzL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 542050.0520436782,
      "y": 39743.89481255662,
      "width": 560.1597900390625,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1956873727,
      "version": 215,
      "versionNonce": 1330933425,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785139279905,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "this is limit order where\ni can buy 2 BTC at price of\n100000 USD/BTC . and this is the\nmax possible price which i can pay",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "this is limit order where\ni can buy 2 BTC at price of\n100000 USD/BTC . and this is the\nmax possible price which i can pay",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cFSbQXwwWL3j5V7-DcRtl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 541227.5519673843,
      "y": 40272.22809502732,
      "width": 1848.4193115234375,
      "height": 630,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 440237329,
      "version": 56,
      "versionNonce": 1763835697,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785139572112,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. check if the user is authenticated\n2. validate the request body\n3. check if the user has enough balance balances[userId][symbol]>=price*quantity\n4. lock the funds in the balances[userId][symbol] -> balances[userId][symbol] = {\n        available:balances[userId][symbol].available - price*quantity,\n        locked:balances[userId][symbol].locked + price*quantity\n}\n5. read the orderbook\n6. run the matching logic to match this order\n7. update the balance\n8. Insert the trades in the trades/fills table -  also in order\n9. update the order status\n10. return response - {message:\"order placed\",filledQuantity:filledQuantity,remainingQuantity:remainingQuantity}\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. check if the user is authenticated\n2. validate the request body\n3. check if the user has enough balance balances[userId][symbol]>=price*quantity\n4. lock the funds in the balances[userId][symbol] -> balances[userId][symbol] = {\n        available:balances[userId][symbol].available - price*quantity,\n        locked:balances[userId][symbol].locked + price*quantity\n}\n5. read the orderbook\n6. run the matching logic to match this order\n7. update the balance\n8. Insert the trades in the trades/fills table -  also in order\n9. update the order status\n10. return response - {message:\"order placed\",filledQuantity:filledQuantity,remainingQuantity:remainingQuantity}\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
