      "updated": 1785140341613,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "monolith ---> everything lives in one process\n\n\nVery simple to build\nEasy to debug\nGeart for learning\n\n\nDatabase become bottleneck\nmatching speed is limited by DB performance\nScaling everything means ....no optiimal ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "monolith ---> everything lives in one process\n\n\nVery simple to build\nEasy to debug\nGeart for learning\n\n\nDatabase become bottleneck\nmatching speed is limited by DB performance\nScaling everything means ....no optiimal ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
