      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785834585352,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.authenticate\n2 validate body -  if marker not exist then create new in orderbook\n3 check balance & lock funds\n4. create order in db\n5. matching the order - if not match then sit on order book\n6. mathcing ends\n7. add order on order book -  as it was no filled\n8. update the order -  if need\n9 fill the table of fills or Trades -  if order executed\n10 response ",
      "fontSize": 21.220078415262414,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.authenticate\n2 validate body -  if marker not exist then create new in orderbook\n3 check balance & lock funds\n4. create order in db\n5. matching the order - if not match then sit on order book\n6. mathcing ends\n7. add order on order book -  as it was no filled\n8. update the order -  if need\n9 fill the table of fills or Trades -  if order executed\n10 response ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
